ense_file: octomap/LICENSE.txt\n  summary: An Efficient Probabilistic 3D Mapping Framework Based on Octrees\n\nextra:\n  feedstock-name: octomap\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - jeongseok-meta\n    - jcarpent\n    - wolfv\n",
